Sun Oct 18 05:55:39 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <martin@pluskal.org>

- Update to version 1.1.4
  * Project revival: Qt 6 support added (Qt 5 still supported),
    CMake build system alongside qmake
  * Undo/redo rework on QUndoStack with per-canvas command
    stack, rotation and perspective support
  * Fixed wordcloud generation and random number compatibility
  * Fixed build with Qt 5.15 (qrand removal, deprecated API)
  * Graceful handling of SIGINT/SIGTERM
  * New and updated translations (Russian, Traditional Chinese,
    Greek)
- Packaging changes:
  * Upstream moved to the fotowall organisation: update URL
    and Source0 accordingly
  * Drop patches adopted upstream:
    fotowall-1.0-fix-build-against-qt-5.11.0.patch
    0001-Fix-build-with-Qt-5.15.patch
  * README.markdown renamed to README.md upstream
  * Drop obsolete Group tag, add explicit gcc and make
    BuildRequires

